@baseUrl = http://localhost:7777
@accessToken = replace-with-local-test-token

### Push public key: the VAPID key the browser needs to subscribe (503 when push is not configured)
GET {{baseUrl}}/communication/push-subscriptions/public-key
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Push subscription: register this browser for the caller (204; an endpoint registered by another account moves to the caller; 422 unless the host is a trusted push service: fcm.googleapis.com, updates.push.services.mozilla.com, *.push.apple.com or *.notify.windows.com)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/communication/push-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/replace-with-local-endpoint",
  "keys": {
    "p256dh": "replace-with-local-p256dh-key",
    "auth": "replace-with-local-auth-secret"
  }
}

### Streak reminder preference: the account-wide switch, off by default
GET {{baseUrl}}/communication/streak-reminder-preference
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Streak reminder preference: turn the reminder on for every browser
PUT {{baseUrl}}/communication/streak-reminder-preference
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}
